strings.en:
{0b:08}【 Volkmeyer the Warrior 】{0b:09}
Tiara-chan's sure takin' her time...{1a}...Not that it's been more than ten
minutes, but it's no good if the tavern
closes on us.{0c:fe}

Sorry for draggin' you along. But I'm a
little curious about you.{1a}Oh, and just so we're clear, I ain't
courtin' ya. That ain't my thing neither.{0c:fe}

It's a small town. I didn't have to go
around asking for rumors about you;
they just found their way to my ears.{1a}Of all fourteen rookies, the one with the
worst luck and the least sense... That's
about the size of it.{1a}So, as for what I make of you, now that
we've met...{0c:fe}

